<title>TUNISIA: No immediate plan for wheat tender -Tunisia trade.</title>
<headline>No immediate plan for wheat tender -Tunisia trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia has no immediate plans to tender for wheat, traders said on Saturday.</p>
<p>They were commenting after U.S. exporters said on Friday that Tunisia may seek as early as next week about 100,000 tonnes of optional origin wheat for delivery in January and February.</p>
<p>&quot;There is no such a plan for the time being,&quot; a Tunisian trader said.</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
